{#
  BeMart Shopping login page — EC-CUBE goShoppingLogin.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Shopping/login.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Shopping/login.twig).

  FORM page (Ray.WebFormModule) — see var/templates/README.md. Markup
  skeleton, the `ec-role` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-grid3` / `ec-login` /
  `ec-grid2` / `ec-guest` classes and the block structure are kept
  verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  EC-CUBE's `shopping_login` route reuses `CustomerLoginType` — the same
  Symfony form type the standalone `goLogin` page uses — so the Shopping
  Login resource exposes the same `LoginForm` (an AbstractForm) as
  `body.form`. The inputs are rendered through it:

    {{ form.input('login_email')|raw }}   <- real <input> w/ id/attrs
    {{ form.input('login_pass')|raw }}

  The field names / ids / attributes in LoginForm::init() are ported
  from EC-CUBE's `CustomerLoginType` + the template's `form_widget`
  `attr` options. The render-diff test stubs EC-CUBE's `form_widget` to
  delegate to the SAME LoginForm so the inputs diff to ZERO. Validation
  authority stays with the Be Becoming chain — the form is a
  field-definition + renderer.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}` -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `csrf_token('authenticate')` — EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget; the
     hidden `_csrf_token` input is kept (structure) bound to the body's
     `csrfToken` (null in the html context). EC-CUBE-runtime only.
   - `is_granted('IS_AUTHENTICATED_REMEMBERED')` — EC-CUBE auth-state
     runtime. The guest-purchase grid cell renders only for a
     not-already-remembered visitor; BeMart's html context has no auth
     state, so the cell is rendered unconditionally (the common
     anonymous-checkout case — the page IS the unauthenticated branch).
   - `BaseInfo.option_remember_me` — the remember-me checkbox depends on
     a BaseInfo flag the body does not carry, so it is OMITTED (never
     invented), recorded as a residual in the render test.
   - `error` — Symfony's authentication-error object. Form-level
     messages render from the body's `message` instead.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'cart_page' %}
{% set route = 'shopping_login' %}
{% set title = 'ログイン' %}

{% block main %}

    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1>ログイン</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-grid3">

            <div class="ec-grid3__cell2">
                <form name="shopping_login" id="shopping_login" method="post" action="{{ url('mypage_login') }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_target_path" value="{{ url('shopping') }}" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="_failure_path" value="{{ url('shopping_login') }}" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token('bemart')) }}">
                    <div class="ec-login">
                        <div class="ec-login__icon">
                            <div class="ec-icon"><img src="{{ asset('assets/icon/user.svg') }}" alt=""></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ec-login__input">
                            <div class="ec-input">
                                {{ form.input('login_email')|raw }}
                                {{ form.input('login_pass')|raw }}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% if message is defined and message %}
                            <p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ message }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="ec-grid2">
                            <div class="ec-grid2__cell">
                                <div class="ec-login__actions">
                                    <button type="submit" class="ec-blockBtn--cancel">ログイン</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="ec-grid2__cell">
                                <div class="ec-login__link"><a class="ec-link" href="{{ url('forgot') }}">ログイン情報をお忘れですか？</a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="ec-login__link"><a class="ec-link" href="{{ url('entry') }}">新規会員登録</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <div class="ec-grid3__cell">
                <div class="ec-guest">
                    <div class="ec-guest__inner">
                        <p>会員登録をせずに購入手続きをされたい方は、下記よりお進みください。</p>
                        <div class="ec-guest__actions"><a class="ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="{{ url('shopping_nonmember') }}">ゲスト購入</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
